00:56:07.649 --> 00:56:11.230
Actually the last 10 minutes or so even though we are over

00:56:11.250 --> 00:56:20.589
with them, I viewed as actually quite memorable. And I would

00:56:20.609 --> 00:56:24.969
invest it for anything. I want to thank everybody, the

00:56:24.989 --> 00:56:30.799
speakers, the participants, the clearing house, Paul for a

00:56:30.819 --> 00:56:34.250
wonderful day. And I learned a lot and I hope you get to do

